---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy & Cookies"
  description="How this site uses analytics, browser storage, and third-party resources"
>
  <article class="prose mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h1>Privacy & Cookies</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: September 21, 2026</em></p>

    <p>
      This personal site is operated by Bakti Satria Adhityatama. For questions about this notice or
      your privacy, email <a href="mailto:bakti.satria.a@gmail.com">bakti.satria.a@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics and Cloudflare</h2>
    <p>
      Cloudflare serves this site and may process requests for traffic, performance, and security metrics.
      Those edge metrics are separate from the optional Cloudflare Insights browser beacon. The beacon
      measures visits and page performance and only loads after you choose <strong>Allow analytics</strong>.
      If you reject it, this site does not load the beacon. Cloudflare says the beacon does not read or
      store cookies, local storage, or other browser storage. Cloudflare may set cookies needed for
      security features if those features are enabled.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can change your choice at any time with <strong>Analytics settings</strong> in the footer.
      Rejecting analytics stops future beacon loads; it cannot retract metrics already sent.
    </p>
    <p>
      See Cloudflare's
      <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/speed/observatory/rum-beacon/">Web Analytics beacon privacy information</a>
      and <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/reference/policies-compliances/cloudflare-cookies/">cookie documentation</a>
      for details about its services.
    </p>

    <h2>Preferences saved in your browser</h2>
    <p>
      The site saves your light or dark theme choice, the solved state of checkboxes in some docs pages,
      and your analytics choice in your browser's local storage. These preferences
      are used to remember your choices on this device. You can remove them by clearing this site's
      stored data in your browser settings.
    </p>

    <h2>External resources</h2>
    <p>
      Pages load fonts from Google Fonts and math styles from jsDelivr. Pages with diagrams may also
      load Mermaid from jsDelivr. Your browser makes requests to those providers when it loads those
      resources. Links to external websites are governed by those sites' own privacy practices.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      This notice may change if the site's analytics or other services change. The updated date above
      will reflect revisions.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
